<title>BANGLADESH: Dhaka stocks seen mixed.</title>
<headline>Dhaka stocks seen mixed.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share prices on the Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) are expected to be mixed on Wednesday, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market may have a mixed trend. Investors may aim (at) those shares which fell sharply in post-budget sessions. But at the same time the investors are also inclined to sell their scrips as they are under pressure to repay bank loans before the fiscal year ends on June 30,&quot; said broker Mahbub Morshed.</p>
<p>The DSE all-share price index dropped 11.76 points or 1.04 percent to 1,111.49 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
